    <name><![CDATA[Genealogy Resources - Croatia & Surrounds]]></name>
    <description><![CDATA[Highlighting FamilySearch, and other genealogical resources for Croatia and surrounding records. This is a work in Process. Sourced currently from Family Search: https://www.familysearch.org/search/image/index?owc=9RKB-7M9%3A391644801%3Fcc%3D2040054&cc=2040054<br><br>It was also discovered that much of this had already been done and was therefore replicated from some of the work done here: Karta rodoslovnih istraživanja - https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1CN9yPIQh_R27wyc1hHZJm7seKFZY0Ow&usp=sharing<br><br>AND<br><br>Croatia Church Books - Family Search - https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1rVB91vxhtEac7mRAlQjolWDHlIGpiwY&usp=sharing<br>]]></description>
